    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT MY OTHER GAMES!</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Complete tasks &amp; mini-games. Report bodies. Call voting sessions. Hack the station. Overload the reactor. Betray your friends. An online party game of teamwork and betrayal for 4-12  third person! Escape the ship before the countdown runs out! Don't get fooled by the rogue AI.<br><br>Kill your friends!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/d97cefab130a20cd2d7a8514d58bd866.poster.avif?t=1721234838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/d97cefab130a20cd2d7a8514d58bd866.webm?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/d97cefab130a20cd2d7a8514d58bd866.mp4?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Voting System!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/9f621d4f7f35f9e73c27659cd9e1ffcf.poster.avif?t=1721234838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/9f621d4f7f35f9e73c27659cd9e1ffcf.webm?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/9f621d4f7f35f9e73c27659cd9e1ffcf.mp4?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hack the world...errr, station!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/9bf53bbc3b17169aa593e5ebbcd40193.poster.avif?t=1721234838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/9bf53bbc3b17169aa593e5ebbcd40193.webm?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/9bf53bbc3b17169aa593e5ebbcd40193.mp4?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Basic b mini games + QT events for tasks<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/122d41bbee2f1f382c835753d996b717.poster.avif?t=1721234838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/122d41bbee2f1f382c835753d996b717.webm?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445370/extras/122d41bbee2f1f382c835753d996b717.mp4?t=1721234838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Private and Public Game Lobbies.<br></li><li> Built-in proximity chat<br></li><li> 3 Maps<br></li><li> Customize victory conditions and various cooldowns</li></ul><br>Crewmates:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete tasks to delay the self-destruct sequence and prepare your ship for evacuation<br></li><li>Androids will block your efforts by hacking your visor, ejecting you from the airlock, causing reactor meltdowns<br></li><li>Use security cameras to keep an eye on suspicious activities<br></li><li>Call emergency meetings or report dead bodies to vote to eject the rogue AI</li></ul><br>Imposters:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>EXTERMINATE all humans. Trick the silly humans into ejecting each other.<br></li><li>Hack the systems on board to prey on the humans</li></ul>",
